scratch/

# Images & plots (per user rule: do not push images; preserve app icons in assets/)
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.gif
*.webp
*.ico
!assets/*.png

# External dataset zip archives (> 100MB limit) and duplicate uncategorized copies
*.zip
research/IO-VNBD/*.zip
research/IO-VNBD/Unsynchronised*
research/IO-VNBD/Synchronised V abd S datasets/Uncategorised*
